# TTCN-3: ETSI ES 201 873-1 (TTCN-3 Core Language); requirements/languages/ttcn3.md
name     ttcn3 ttcn
keyword  module import from all type record union set of enumerated component port message procedure
keyword  testcase function altstep control var const template runs on system return if else for while
keyword  do alt interleave repeat timer start stop send receive setverdict map connect execute
type     integer float boolean charstring universal octetstring bitstring hexstring verdicttype
builtin  true false pass fail inconc none error self mtc
line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : doubled
operators  +-*/:=<>&!.?@
calls
